  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation of Results Guidance to support the collection of results</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This funding will create methodology notes that will help to define FCDO&#x2019;s overall approach to collecting results on the number of children it has supported to access education and to learn. These results will be used within FCDO&#x2019;s Education Results Framework. The collected results will be used for multiple internal and external communications and reporting requirements.</narrative>
  </description>
